 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-id1169084652220\" class=\"watch-physics\" data-label=\"\">\n<div data-type=\"title\" id=\"7\">Watch Physics: Parabolic Mirrors and Real Images </div>\n<p id=\"fs-id1169084670864\" class=\" \">This video explains parabolic mirrors and real images.</p>\n<div data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id1169084561658\" data-alt=\"This tutorial explains parabolic mirrors and real images.\">\n<div data-type=\"alternatives\" class=\"os-has-iframe os-has-link\">\n<a class=\"os-is-link\" target=\"_window\" href=\"https://www.openstaxcollege.org/l/02paramirrorimg\">Click to view content</a><iframe width=\"660\" height=\"371.4\" src=\"https://www.openstaxcollege.org/l/02paramirrorimg\" class=\"os-is-iframe\"><!-- no-selfclose --></iframe>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
